# Sideload after changes

When you finish implementing or fixing something in this Android project:

1. Build the debug APK: `./gradlew :app:assembleDebug` (use `JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-17-openjdk-amd64` and `ANDROID_HOME=~/Android/Sdk` if needed).
2. Sideload to the test tablet: `adb connect 192.168.3.62:45551` then `adb -s 192.168.3.62:45551 install -r app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk`.
3. Mention sideload success in the summary.

Do this on every completed task that touches the app, unless the user explicitly says not to sideload.
